title: "Mighty Mini Mustang"
---

::: {.callout-tip}
## Initial user specifications

1. **FT Mighty Mini Mustang MKR2**, Flite Test plan.
2. **Flat plate foam**, hand cut and hot glued.
3. **Span**: 622 mm (24.5 in) tip to tip.
4. **Wing area**: 0.0742 m2 (115 in2), aspect ratio 5.2.
5. **CG**: 25 mm aft of the wing leading edge.
6. **Power**: 2205 2300 kv motor, 6x4.5 prop, 3S LiPo.
7. **Controls**: aileron, elevator and rudder, 12 degree throws.
:::



